# reset-token-security.test — password-reset token failure modes
# (S3). Adapted from OWASP Forgot Password Cheat Sheet + observed
# real-world resetPasswordToken bugs.
#
# Threat model: attacker with network access + partial knowledge
# (email address of the victim). All cases below MUST hold; a
# failure = account takeover.
#
# Adopter customization:
#   - Wire `_request_reset(client, email)` to your "forgot
#     password" endpoint.
#   - Wire `_reset_with_token(client, token, new_password)` to
#     your reset-confirm endpoint.
#   - Wire `_capture_reset_token(email)` to intercept the token
#     from your outgoing mail (use a test mail backend).

import time

import pytest


